# Project Rules: Bangla Handwritten Fonts & Dynamic Paper Textures System

## 1. System Overview & Philosophy
To eliminate repetitive layouts and provide an immersive, tactile stationery reading experience for competitive exam notes (BCS, Bank, Govt jobs), every newly generated page or reading layout must automatically integrate the **Bangla Handwritten Font Randomizer** and the **10 Realistic Paper Textures System**.

## 2. Core Assets & Include Requirements
Any newly created HTML e-book page, review layout, or interactive note must include the following assets:

```html
<!-- 1. Google Font Fallbacks (Optional but Recommended) -->
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Atma:wght@500;600;700&family=Baloo+Da+2:wght@500;600;700&family=Hind+Siliguri:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<!-- 2. Core Stylesheets -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="sketchnote.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="bangla-fonts.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="paper-textures.css">

<!-- 3. Dynamic Randomization Engine (Place before </body> or in <head>) -->
<script src="paper-engine.js"></script>
```

*(Note: For files located in subfolders such as `Live MCQ Bangla Literature/`, adjust relative paths accordingly: `../bangla-fonts.css`, `../paper-textures.css`, `../paper-engine.js`).*

## 3. Dynamic Font Randomization Rules
- **Automatic Assignment:** On every page render or refresh, `paper-engine.js` automatically picks a random font from `Fonts/` / `font/` and dynamically assigns it to CSS variables:
  - `--paper-font-active`
  - `--sk-font-bn`
  - `--paper-font`
- **Fallback Font Stack:** The font stack must always fall back gracefully:
  `'<SelectedFont>', 'Nirlipta', 'FNRayhanHosthoshoily', 'Atma', 'Baloo Da 2', 'Hind Siliguri', cursive, sans-serif`
- **Manual Font Override Classes:** If a component requires a specific font, apply utility classes:
  - `.font-nirlipta` (নির্লিপ্ত)
  - `.font-rayhan` (রায়হান হস্তশৈলী)
  - `.font-durbar` (দুর্বার)
  - `.font-begum-zia` (বেগম জিয়া)
  - `.font-anirban` (অনির্বাণ)
  - `.font-badhon-ador` (বাঁধন আদর)
  - `.font-shorif-rafid` (শরীফ রাফিদ)
  - `.font-hasan` (হাসান কলকাতা)
  - `.font-ahasan` (আহসান নীলাঞ্জনা)
  - `.font-mamun` (মামুন বর্ণলিপি)
  - `.font-gedamala` (বাঁধন গেঁদামালা)
  - `.font-kornofuli` (কর্ণফুলী)
  - `.font-shadhinata` (স্বাধীনতা ২.০)
  - `.font-trimohona` (ত্রিমোহনা)
  - `.font-prapti` (প্রাপ্তি)
  - `.font-abu-sayed` (কোডপত্র আবু সাঈদ)
  - `.font-ekush` (একুশ)
  - `.font-priotoma` (প্রিয়তমা)
  - `.font-priotoma-2` (প্রিয়তমা ২)
  - `.font-dinar` (দিনার বর্ণ)

## 4. 10 High-Fidelity Paper Textures Specification
Use base container `.paper-container` or `.sk-page`. The engine randomly assigns one of the following 10 styles, or they can be explicitly styled:

1. `.paper-lined-notebook` (দাগটানা খাতা): Left double red vertical margin line (at 4.2rem) and 32px blue horizontal ruled lines.
2. `.paper-old-aged` (পুরাতন কাগজ): Warm sepia/cream base, subtle grunge grain overlay, and edge oxidation vignette.
3. `.paper-torn` (ছেঁড়া পাতা): Realistic jagged multi-vertex polygon clip-path with exposed white cellulose fiber underlayer.
4. `.paper-dot-grid` (ডট গ্রিড খাতা): Modern bullet journal layout with 24px clean radial-gradient dot matrix.
5. `.paper-graph` (গ্রাফ পেপার): Technical drafting layout with 100px major and 20px minor blueprint grid lines.
6. `.paper-crumpled` (কুঁচকানো কাগজ): Multi-faceted angular linear-gradients and 3D shadows simulating crinkled paper.
7. `.paper-coffee-stained` (কফি বা চায়ের দাগযুক্ত কাগজ): Concentric radial gradients simulating dried coffee mug rings and droplet splatters.
8. `.paper-legal-pad` (হলুদ আইনি প্যাড): Canary yellow paper background with double red margin line and faux-leather top binding strip.
9. `.paper-burnt-edge` (পোড়া কাগজের স্ক্রোল): Ancient scroll parchment with deep smoky charred-brown perimeter vignette.
10. `.paper-kraft` (কার্ডবোর্ড বা ক্রাফট কাগজ): Organic fibrous brown recycled kraft paper with tactile cross-hatch texture.

## 5. Coding Standards & Integrity
- **Responsive Mobile First:** Always support Samsung A23 and mobile viewports (`overflow-x: clip`, fluid padding, compact margins on mobile).
- **Full Dark Mode:** All 10 textures and fonts must adapt automatically when `[data-theme="dark"]`, `body.dark-mode`, or `.theme-dark` is toggled.
- **Zero Fabrication:** The paper styling is an aesthetic visual presentation layer. Never alter or fabricate original exam questions or authentic answers.
